{"id": "97110242", "name": "גבול מהצורה 1^∞ – שימוש ישיר בגבול של אוילר, (1+a/x)^(bx) או (1+ax)^(b/x)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>חשבו את הגבול</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to {{CT:0}}}\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{ {{CT:2}} }= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{2/3}\\)</span> מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">e^(2/3)</code> או <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(2/3)</code>, עם סוגריים סביב המעריך.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> זו צורה לא מוגדרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1^\\infty\\)</span>. מביאים את הביטוי לצורה של הגבול הידוע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lim_{u\\to 0}\\left(1+u\\right)^{1/u}=e\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הצבה</b><br>מסמנים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:3}}\\)</span>. כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\to {{CT:0}}\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\to 0\\)</span>. הבסיס הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1+u\\)</span>, והמעריך הוא<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}}=\\frac{ {{CT:4}} }{u} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הגבול</b><br>לפי חוקי חזקות<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{ {{CT:2}} }=\\left(1+u\\right)^{\\frac{ {{CT:4}} }{u}}=\\left[\\left(1+u\\right)^{\\frac{1}{u}}\\right]^{ {{CT:4}} } \\]</p>הביטוי שבסוגריים המרובעים שואף ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e\\)</span>, והפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t^{ {{CT:4}} }\\)</span> רציפה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=e\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lim_{x\\to {{CT:0}}}\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{ {{CT:2}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הבסיס אמנם שואף ל-1, אבל המעריך שואף לאינסוף: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1^\\infty\\)</span> היא צורה לא מוגדרת, והגבול אינו בהכרח 1.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ab", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">זה המעריך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e\\)</span>. הגבול הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e\\)</span> בחזקת המספר הזה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tw1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">שימו לב גם למקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}\\)</span> שבמעריך.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tw2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">שימו לב גם למקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\)</span> שבבסיס.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "ab", "b", "bs", "ex", "kd", "pt", "ta", "tw1", "tw2", "u"], "nvariants": 50}